  "created": "2022-08-18T15:51:36.795Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nThe Camera Drone (mouse wheel button) in desktop mode should prevent all input to your movement, it blocks WASD, but it does still allow you to Jump, Crouch and Prone.\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Open your Desktop Camera\n2. Press `Mouse Wheel` to move the camera lens / enter Drone Mode\n3. Press `Space` to Jump (or `Z` to Prone / `C` to Crouch)\nIf you do this you will notice that you will still Jump / Prone / Crouch, even though you should not be able to do so. Not using the Drone Camera does prevent all movement btw. (Just having the Camera open)\n# Attachments: \nHere is a video of me showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/qmbbl0",
